                            <comment id="16068816" author="githubbot" created="Thu, 29 Jun 2017 19:22:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Github user herval commented on the issue:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2428&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/2428&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    hmm.. It actually seems that setFetchSize does not limit the query execution (so it takes forever &amp;amp; hangs Zeppelin)&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Figuring out if there&apos;s a way to show results are truncated + use setMaxRows&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
